<title>CHILE: Chile's Copec reports higher Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Chile's Copec reports higher Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper pulp and oil conglomerate Compania de Petroleo de Chile SA, or Copec, reported the following results for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>				 Q1 1997		   Q1 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		    32.6		     29.9</p>
<p> Operating profit	     6.7			7.3</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	26.7		     23.3</p>
<p> Total revenues	     188			163</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211))</p>
</text>
